  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Using the stated convention that Comet Halley appears once every \\(75\\) years:\n\n\\[\n75\\text{ years}\\times 12\\frac{\\text{months}}{\\text{year}}=900\\text{ months}.\n\\]\n\nThus, the treated orbital period is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{900\\text{ months}}.\n\\]\n\n(Using the actual \\(76\\)-year orbital period would give \\(76\\times12=912\\) months.)",
    "With the corrected orbital period of \\(75\\) years:\n\n\\[\n75 \\times 12 = 900\\text{ months}.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{900\\text{ months}}\n\\]",
